vulkan-systems
  gpu/       VulkanEngine resource ownership, staging, shaders, compute, culling
  render/    frame scheduling, targets, HDR/LDR buffers, pipelines, draws
  bvh/       GPU LBVH acceleration
  spatial/   CPU BVH index and frustum queries
  network/   IPv4/IPv6 UDP, DTLS 1.2 mTLS, reliable session and host
  jobs/      bounded multithreaded jobs and completion queue

Each module has a standalone build.c with C++17 APIs.
Root build.c exports VulkanSystems (gpu/render), VulkanSpatial, VulkanNetwork,
and VulkanJobs as independent static library targets. GPU and render depend
on VulkanEngine. Network and jobs do not depend on Vulkan.

Host initializes and shuts down the Vulkan device and swapchain.
No game-specific scene serialization, weapon logic, or authority rules live here.

